    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "Warriors of the Star-Clan",
        "id": "d524-fe19-f255-0447",
        "hidden": false,
        "description": "A Unit with this Special Rule gains several benefits from performing combat actions:\n•This unit and the target of their Melee Attack or Charge does not suffer any Mental Statuses/Tests if they were to suffer any after the end of that action and neither unit can leave Melee Combat until one unit is completely destroyed;excluding the one caused by Overwhelming Assault.\n•If this Unit has equal or more models than the unit targeted by their Melee Attack or Charge, they gain the Overwhelming Assault Special Rule until the end of the attack action.\n•If this unit had an amount of WPN Dice during the Wound Step that is equal or more than to the amount of models in that targeted unit prior to any models being removed in that unit, that unit suffers from Suppressive Fire(1)."
      }
    ],
