                    "hidden": false,
                    "id": "b703-69e4-2e70-b824",
                    "characteristics": [
                      {
                        "name": "Lore",
                        "typeId": "8f51-2099-f67c-300e",
                        "$text": "The Nuntach Mark-1 was designed to do one thing and to do it good enough(Until it could get back to the repair bay) and that was to weather any storm that it must walk through. The harsh warfare and the harsher conditions of Regol made these mechs a mix of a diver's suit and several fridges worth of armor."
